OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEvening
OL,6,Fshowers becoming confined to coastal
OL,7,Fareas overnight. Largely cloudy, but
OL,8,Fsome clear spells are likely, allowing
OL,9,Fa few frost and fog patches to develop.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAny fog patches will be slow
OL,12,Fto clear on Monday morning, but bright
OL,13,For sunny spells gradually developing.
OL,14,FCoastal showers slowly dying out in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Chilly.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMostly
OL,18,Fdry Tuesday with sunny spells after
OL,19,Fany early fog clears. Mostly dry
OL,20,FWednesday and Thursday with isolated
OL,21,Fshowers. Temperatures turning cooler.
